  <attributes><entry><string>Width</string><int>12</int></entry><entry><string>Description</string><string>MEM/WB pipeline register.  On a clock edge, each field keeps its value, takes its input when EN is set, or clears when CLR is set.  CLR overrides EN.</string></entry></attributes>
